        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "value" : "Feature Shortcuts" } }
      }
    },
    "以下快捷键为系统内置，不可修改。Cmd+; 将 Finder 选中的文件移动到临时空间；Cmd+L 将选中的文本转换为待办事项列表。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "value" : "These shortcuts are built-in and cannot be changed. Cmd+; moves selected Finder files to the temp space. Cmd+L converts selected text to a todo list." } }
      }
